       "page_printed": "860", "page_pdf": 96, "strength": "SUPPORT", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "Notes for Figure 6P-1—Typical Application 1 Work Beyond the Shoulder"},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-FIG-TITLE", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": null,
       "page_printed": "861", "page_pdf": 97, "strength": "SUPPORT", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "Figure 6P-1. Work Beyond the Shoulder (TA-1)"},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-N1", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": "1",
       "page_printed": "860", "page_pdf": 96, "strength": "GUIDANCE", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "If the work space is in the median of a divided highway, an advance warning sign should also be placed on the left-hand side of the directional roadway."},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-N2", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": "2",
       "page_printed": "860", "page_pdf": 96, "strength": "OPTION", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "The ROAD WORK AHEAD sign may be replaced with other appropriate signs such as the SHOULDER WORK sign. The SHOULDER WORK sign may be used for work adjacent to the shoulder."},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-N3", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": "3",
       "page_printed": "860", "page_pdf": 96, "strength": "OPTION", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "The ROAD WORK AHEAD sign may be omitted where the work space is behind a barrier, more than 24 inches behind the curb, or 15 feet or more from the edge of any roadway."},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-N4", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": "4",
       "page_printed": "860", "page_pdf": 96, "strength": "OPTION", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "For short-term, short-duration or mobile operation, all signs and channelizing devices may be eliminated if a vehicle with activated high-intensity rotating, flashing, oscillating, or strobe lights is used."},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-N5", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": "5",
       "page_printed": "860", "page_pdf": 96, "strength": "OPTION", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "Vehicle hazard warning signals may be used to supplement high-intensity rotating, flashing, oscillating, or strobe lights."},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-N6", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": "6",
       "page_printed": "860", "page_pdf": 96, "strength": "STANDARD", "evidence": "QUOTE", "transcription": null, "figure_render": null,
       "quote": "Vehicle hazard warning signals shall not be used instead of the vehicle’s high-intensity rotating, flashing, oscillating, or strobe lights."},
      {"id": "SR-6P1-FIG-SIGNS", "source_document_id": "SD-MUTCD11-CH6-2023-12", "section": "6P.01", "paragraph": null, "table": null, "figure": "6P-1", "note": null,
       "page_printed": "861", "page_pdf": 97, "strength": "GUIDANCE", "evidence": "FIGURE_TRANSCRIPTION", "quote": null,
       "transcription": "Figure 6P-1 shows one direction (northbound). A W20-1 ROAD WORK AHEAD sign stands on the right-hand roadside of that approach, at dimension A upstream of the work space, which is drawn as a hatched area beyond the shoulder. No channelizing devices, taper or buffer are drawn.",
       "figure_render": {"uri": "tests/fixtures/rule_pack_sources/figures/figure_6P-1_p861.png", "sha256": "35dce7e5cd05bd3e0eab7485eda3990b6e92027ceedaed15877a555656182faf", "size": 62377, "media_type": "image/png"}}
    ],
